        {
          "id": 874931412,
          "type": null,
          "body": "You need to fix\n\n```\nError: the blurb for hf_pie_ixia_udpAppResponseTime (\"UDP Average Application Response Time (us)\") matches the field name (\"UDP Average Application Response Time (us)\") in epan/dissectors/packet-netflow.c\nError: the blurb for hf_pie_ixia_quicConnSetupTime (\"Time to complete a QUIC Handshake (us)\") matches the field name (\"Time to complete a QUIC Handshake (us)\") in epan/dissectors/packet-netflow.c\nError: the blurb for hf_pie_ixia_quicConnRTT (\"QUIC Network RTT (us)\") matches the field name (\"QUIC Network RTT (us)\") in epan/dissectors/packet-netflow.c\nError: the blurb for hf_pie_ixia_quicAppResponseTime (\"QUIC RTT for application packets (us)\") matches the field name (\"QUIC RTT for application packets (us)\") in epan/dissectors/packet-netflow.\n```",
